sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / SDK
    participant APIServer as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as training-operator Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Controller as training-operator Controller<br/>controller-runtime
    participant Workers as Worker/Master Pods
    participant HeadlessSvc as Headless Services
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>8080/TCP TLS

    Note over User,HeadlessSvc: Flow 1: Training Job Submission

    User->>APIServer: kubectl apply PyTorchJob/TFJob/MPIJob/...<br/>Auth: User credentials
    APIServer->>Webhook: POST /validate-kubeflow-org-v1-*<br/>HTTPS/9443, TLS (cluster profile)<br/>Auth: Kubernetes admission CA
    Webhook-->>APIServer: Admission Response (allow/deny)
    APIServer-->>User: Created / Rejected

    Note over Controller: Informer cache detects new CR<br/>(label-filtered for operator-managed resources)

    Controller->>APIServer: Create Worker/Master Pod specs<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    APIServer-->>Controller: Pods Created
    Controller->>APIServer: Create Headless Service<br/>for inter-worker DNS discovery
    APIServer-->>Controller: Service Created

    opt PyTorch Jobs Only
        Controller->>APIServer: Create NetworkPolicy<br/>restrict ingress to same-job Pods + monitoring
        APIServer-->>Controller: NetworkPolicy Created
    end

    opt Gang-Scheduling Enabled
        Controller->>APIServer: Create PodGroup CR<br/>(Volcano or scheduler-plugins)
        APIServer-->>Controller: PodGroup Created
    end

    opt MPI Jobs Only
        Note over Workers: kubectl-delivery init container<br/>copies kubectl binary to shared volume
    end

    Workers->>Workers: Distributed training<br/>(framework-specific communication)
    Controller->>APIServer: Update job status<br/>(Running → Succeeded/Failed)
    APIServer-->>Controller: Status Updated

    Note over Prometheus,Controller: Flow 2: Metrics Collection

    Prometheus->>Controller: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP/8080 TLS (cluster profile)<br/>Auth: None
    Controller-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics<br/>(controller-runtime metrics)
